  nodes:
  - message: I'm at the shed.
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 1
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
  - message: Where are you?
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 2
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 300, y: 0}
  - message: 
    isPlayer: 1
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies:
    - replyText: "I\u2019m sitting inside on the bench. You're here already?"
      nextNode: 3
    - replyText: "No way. I\u2019m looking around right now, and there\u2019s no
        one."
      nextNode: 4
    nextNode: 0
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 600, y: 0}
  - message: "I\u2019m standing right in front of that bench. There\u2019s no one
      here."
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 5
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 900, y: 0}
  - message: I don't see you either. The shed is completely empty. Just a single
      light.
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 5
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 900, y: 130}
  - message: Listen, let me finish the story.
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 6
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 1500, y: 0}
  - message: Years ago, a woman vanished at this shed.
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 7
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 1800, y: 0}
  - message: Her name was Paeng.
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 8
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 2100, y: 0}
  - message: She wasn't alone that night. Another guy was waiting for the bus too.
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 9
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 2400, y: 0}
  - message: But after that night, no one knows for sure what happened to those two.
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 10
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 2700, y: 0}
  - message: You said someone's been texting you how to survive, right?
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 11
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 3000, y: 0}
  - message: So how the hell do they know that?
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 12
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 3300, y: 0}
  - message: What do you mean?
    isPlayer: 1
    scriptedLine: 1
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 13
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 3600, y: 0}
  - message: Have you ever wondered how they know about this shed?
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 14
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 3900, y: 0}
  - message: And what if the person texting you was there before...
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 15
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 4200, y: 0}
  - message: Why haven't they come out of there yet?
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 16
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 4500, y: 0}
  - message: Think about it carefully.
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 17
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 4800, y: 0}
  - message: I'll be waiting right here.
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 18
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 5100, y: 0}
  - message: 
    isPlayer: 1
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies:
    - replyText: So what am I supposed to do now?!
      nextNode: 19
    - replyText: So I've been following them this whole time?
      nextNode: 20
    nextNode: 0
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 5400, y: 0}
  - message: I don't know. But I want to tell you this...
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 21
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 5700, y: 0}
  - message: "Yeah. But it\u2019s not too late."
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 21
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 5700, y: 130}
  - message: '"DO NOT get on the bus they tell you to get on."'
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 22
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 6300, y: 0}
  - message: "I\u2019ll wait right here until you get out."
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 23
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 6600, y: 0}
  - message: '[Ton went offline]'
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 24
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 6900, y: 0}
  - message: '[A few seconds later, a chat from an unknown sender popped up]'
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 25
    recordsRule: {fileID: 0}
    recordsAsCooperative: 1
    graphPosition: {x: 7200, y: 0}
  - message: 'Unknown: Your friend talks too much.'
    isPlayer: 0
    scriptedLine: 0
    offersReward: 0
